# Kay Stores — Project checklist

The master todo list lives at **`PROJECT_TODO.md`** in the repo root.

## When to update

After completing any page, feature, or backend system for Kay Stores:

1. Open `PROJECT_TODO.md`
2. Mark the matching item `[x]`
3. Update **Last updated** date
4. Refresh the **Progress summary** counts if items changed

## Do not

- Mark items done for partial or placeholder-only work
- Skip the checklist because work was "small"
- Forget to update when finishing a task in the same session

## Reference

Use `PROJECT_TODO.md` as the source of truth for what is left to build (pages, checkout, AI, Supabase, etc.).
